sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            关于El Diviso\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          El Diviso位于慧兰的Pitalito镇，庄园的主人Jose Uribe Lasso为了远离暴力的生活环境，从娜玲珑搬到了Pitalito，于2000年初购得了El Diviso，开始新的生活篇章。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          选择慧兰，是因为肥沃的土壤与健康多样的生态环境，给了Jose信心，只要努力，种咖啡或者其它任何作物都可以很好的生活下去。\n          <br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TSFhvHVicoryqeKoSkMibXbCmOibvgqMBLEE9DicdtQQ58qHLQ2GXgLmejuiaDLlXWxmeoKzIX3eED72A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Jose将庄园分割了不同的地块分别给它的3个儿子，让他们选择想种的咖啡品种，鼓励他们自己选择合适的处理加工方式，现在庄园里有\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          瑰夏、波旁希爪、卡杜拉、卡杜拉奇罗索、爪哇、粉波旁以及一种叫Bourbon Aji辣椒波旁的波旁品种。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          现在第三代年仅24岁的\n          <span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           Nestor Lasso负责庄园的加工处理和运营。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QZPe6Sx1X6TK2tJ8QFJ3YUbicrTE9u2icxlQ4SGOFPUVobMGVH3J17cycexaXicREFRwAxHgTrkX6Aw/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"outline: 0px;background-size: 16px;border-radius: 8px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;height: 677px !important;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n           关于辣椒波旁 Bourbon Aji\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n          这个名字出现在2021年哥伦比亚的CoE第六名得主的品种描述，据农场主人说，这个品种的成熟咖啡果带有红辣椒的气味，与庄园里的其它波旁不同，因此他独立取种种植，并将其命名为辣椒波旁，目前还不确定该波旁的特殊气味是否只是微气候下孕育的风土味还是真的为一个新的波旁咖啡变异品种。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n           关于处理方式\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n          这一支辣椒波旁采用了多重发酵的方式，鲜果经过浮选筛选后，先做48小时左右的低温厌氧发酵，然后去皮后带着果胶，投入特定的酵母菌种厌氧发酵48小时，最后干燥前用65-70摄氏度的热水冲洗咖啡豆将羊皮纸壳黏连的果胶等残留物冲洗干净，随后开始干燥的过程。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n          最终，这款咖啡带有非常\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n          奔放浓郁\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n          的花\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n          果香气、\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n          好似玫瑰、\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n          草莓、树莓、苹果复合在一起，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n          明亮的果酸，饱满的甜感，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n          丰富有层次\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;text-align: justify;\">\n          。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TSFhvHVicoryqeKoSkMibXbCz14MEzick6QCPT5MYmNicgglROmFhPbBpvJTVW3187tw56XWSGsHqHiag/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          <br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 431px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
